<title>SRI LANKA: Dockyard up on foreign buying.</title>
<headline>Dockyard up on foreign buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombo Dockyard Ltd shares rose 25 cents, or 1.8 percent, at 14 rupees on Friday on foreign buying of 524,800 shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;There are a couple of foreign buyers who see the share as offering good value at current prices,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Nearly one million shares of Dockyard were sold on Thursday to foreign investors, at 13.75 rupees each, brokers said.</p>
<p>The company owns and operates dry docks and repair quays at the Colombo port.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
